<title>USA: Dawson Cty SD, Ga., won by NationsBanc.</title>
<headline>Dawson Cty SD, Ga., won by NationsBanc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBanc said it won $5.910 million of Dawson Cty SD, Ga., general obligaiton sales tax school bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.5834 percent.</p>
